lect the ‘Topics-in-Focus Advanced Research Grant’ on your application form.\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s287\",\"d1\",5872,6259,\"Extending the reach of our grants: If you are operating in countries less-represented among EHA grantees, you will have a competitive advantage in the selection process. ​You can see a full list of these countries on our page about extending the reach of EHA Research Grants. Applicants, who received their PhD or PharmD more than eight years before the closing date, are also eligible.\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s288\",\"d1\",6259,6635,\"If you have questions about your eligibility, you can contact us at [email protected] before submitting an application.\\nHow to apply for an EHA Research Grant\\nWhat an EHA Research Grant covers\\nEHA Research Grant review and selection process\\nShare\\nGrants\\nEHA Research Grants\\nEHA Advanced Research Grant\\nEHA Bilateral Collaborative Grant\\nEHA Innovation Grant\\nEHA Kick-off Grant\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s289\",\"d1\",6635,7016,\"EHA Research Mobility Grant\\nEHA Grants Hall of Fame\\nEHA Travel Grants\\nNon-EHA funding opportunities\\nScope of our grants\\nJoin EHA\\nFull membership\\nJunior membership\\n60-day trial\\nGet involved\\nCareer development\\nScientific meetings\\nAbout us\\nMission and vision\\nJobs\\nSponsor EHA\\nContact us\\nFollow us\\nPrivacy statement\\nTerms and conditions\\nSubscribe\\nCopyright © 2026\\nBecome an EHA Mentor\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s271\",\"d1\",0,381,\"EHA Advanced Research Grant - The European Hematology Association (EHA)EHA Advanced Research Grant - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\\nEHA Advanced Research Grant - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\\nEHA Advanced Research Grant - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\\nCongress\\nHemaSphere\\nAbout EHA\\nSearch\\nConnect & Network\\nClinical practice\\nEducation & Training\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s272\",\"d1\",381,778,\"Research & Innovation\\nJoin EHA\\nLogin\\nEHA2027 Congress\\nEHA20